        "description": {
          "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">廢陋巨人以魔法迫使其身邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">60</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺內一個它能看到的生物進行一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 14</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的魅力豁免。豁免失敗則該生物受</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">27</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">6d8</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點心靈傷害，豁免成功則傷害減半。</span></p><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>The fomorian magically forces a creature it can see within 60 feet of it to make a [[/save ability=cha dc=14]] saving throw. The creature takes 27 ([[/damage 6d8 type=psychic]]) damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p></div>",
