    {
      "_id": "pRc9VnAjjkBseAZP",
      "name": "邪眼詛咒Curse of the Evil Eye",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "136",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">廢陋巨人以一次注視發動其邪眼攻擊，而本次攻擊豁免失敗時，該生物同時還會受到魔法的畸變詛咒。受畸變時，該生物的速度減半，而其屬性檢定、豁免檢定以及基於力量和敏捷的攻擊都具有劣勢。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">受畸變的生物可以在完成一次長休後再進行一次該豁免，豁免成功則終止該效應。</span></p><p>With a stare, the fomorian uses Evil Eye, but on a failed save, the creature is also cursed with magical deformities. While deformed, the creature has its speed halved and has disadvantage on ability checks, saving throws, and attacks based on Strength or Dexterity.</p><p>The transformed creature can repeat the saving throw whenever it finishes a long rest, ending the effect on a success.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
